### 1) CreateBookingDto - Creating the first booking
POST {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-03-15",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-25",
  "guests": 5
}

###

### 2) CreateBookingDto - Creating another booking for a different hotel
POST {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-04-10",
  "checkOut": "2026-04-15",
  "guests": 5
}

### 3) CreateBookingDto - Creating an invalid booking
### Expected Message: The selected dates overlap with an existing booking.
POST {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-03-25",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-28",
  "guests": 1
}

###

### 4) CreateBookingDto - Creating an invalid booking
### Expected Message: The field Guests must be between 1 and 10.
POST {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-03-01",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-05",
  "guests": 0
}

###

### 5) CreateBookingDto - Creating an invalid booking
### Expected Message: The field Guests must be between 1 and 10.
POST {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "hotelId": {{hotelId}},
  "checkIn": "2026-04-25",
  "checkOut": "2026-04-28",
  "guests": 11
}

###

### 6) UpdateBookingDto - Extending the stay period
PUT {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "checkIn": "2026-03-20",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-30",
  "guests": 1
}

###

### 7) UpdateBookingDto - Reducing the stay period
PUT {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "checkIn": "2026-03-21",
  "checkOut": "2026-03-29",
  "guests": 1
}

###

