Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 12) Admin Cancel Booking
PUT {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/admin/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13) User Cancel Booking
PUT {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 14) Listing all bookings for a specific hotel
GET {{HotelListing.API_HostAddress}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
